{"title":"2017 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following values is largest?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/9/8d9da0ce28f45a646ae4b4b07d554c249372f7d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }2+0+1+7\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }2 \\times 0 +1+7\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }2+0 \\times 1 + 7\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }2+0+1 \\times 7\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }2 \\times 0 \\times 1 \\times 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"823\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We will compute each expression.\n</p><p>A) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2f9738368b383d60b20a15babf32fc0dbd33522.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 0 + 1 + 7 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"145\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>B) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/5/f655e136328ef54b3367c09c7644f31f6ef759a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 0 + 1 + 7 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"136\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>C) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/7/287cedc8fbeb750beca0ec5d9f3dd80b2a02e1c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 0 \\times 1 + 7 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"136\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>D) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/0/ef0225f96b7c1e5c0d25e57ac91b22d338f886cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 0 + 1 \\times 7 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"136\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>E) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5aedca124bfdbd2c07db8bc129ea6ad4bb4c2c08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 0 \\times 1 \\times 7 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"136\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Ordering these, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/e/c5e40d0735caf27404b8d0aeaf45db4a40e4d254.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10, 8, 9, 9, 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"17\" />. Out of these, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is the largest number and option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/5/565ab5e3715db52b9176b04dd9991b71f4e93a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> adds up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/d/59d909d0e51544c8cadb2e1b7afccfcfe0525427.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 2+0+1+7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"152\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>- SBose\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We immediately see that every one of the choices, except for A and D, has a number multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This will only make the expression's value smaller. We are left with A and D, but in D, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, whereas in answer choice A, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> out of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, instead of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/d/59d909d0e51544c8cadb2e1b7afccfcfe0525427.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 2+0+1+7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"152\" height=\"30\" /> is your answer.\n</p><p><br />\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/S1gAyiyQWYo\">https://youtu.be/S1gAyiyQWYo</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/cY4NYSAD0vQ\">https://youtu.be/cY4NYSAD0vQ</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/o5Aus-6w1vs\">https://youtu.be/o5Aus-6w1vs</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/S1gAyiyQWYo\">https://youtu.be/S1gAyiyQWYo</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-hea